  "synopsis": "After the Avengers' mission in Latveria to stop Hydra and retrieve Loki's scepter, they encounter the Maximoff twins - Wanda and Pietro. They are mutants with superpowers who want to take revenge on Stark. Wanda infiltrates Tony's mind, and he sees a vision of the demise of all the Avengers. They manage to retrieve the scepter, but now Stark fears his vision and, together with Banner, develops a powerful artificial intelligence based on data from the scepter - Ultron. It was meant to be an invincible shield for Earth. However, Ultron's intelligence proved to be uncontrollable, and it vanished into the network. Instead of becoming Earth's protector, it plans to destroy humanity, believing this is the best way to ensure defense. Now the Avengers will need to regroup again to defeat the rogue artificial intelligence.",
